# Accepted findings for the Jenkins controller image. Each one MUST have a reason and an expiry:
# after the date Trivy reports it again and the build fails, forcing a re-check.

# guava 33.7.1 inside jenkins.war (Jenkins core). Fixed in guava 33.7.2, but no Jenkins LTS ships it
# yet (2.580.2 is the newest LTS as of 2026-11-04). Impact: denial of service. The controller is only
# reachable through the authenticated HTTPS ingress, has no executors and no API token.
# Action: bump the FROM line to the next LTS and delete this entry.
CVE-2026-102554 exp:2026-12-15
